  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Legal Aid for Communities in Puerto Rico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a disaster legal aid initiative with a legal empowerment perspective. We provide legal education and support to families and communities recently affected by Fiona. This program trains pro bono housing and just recovery advocates who accompany communities and also leads advocacy words to ensure equitable recovery. Since 2017, Ayuda Legal Puerto Rico has led disaster legal aid and advocacy efforts regarding recovery in Puerto Rico.</narrative>
  </description>
